      "updated": 1770125049380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Do one heavy job effectevely on\ndedicated hardware tailor made\nfor that job. (like exrtra CPU\ninstructions) All the jobs could\nbe done on the GPU cores but\nwould be cut down in many\ninstructions that would make the\njob take longer to get done. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Do one heavy job effectevely on dedicated hardware tailor made for that job. (like exrtra CPU instructions) All the jobs could be done on the GPU cores but would be cut down in many instructions that would make the job take longer to get done. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
