      "updated": 1770125939613,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The kernel mode driver is like 'OS code' for managing the GPU\ntasks, processes accesing the GPU, permissions, security,\nconcurrency ...  It has full permissions like the OS.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The kernel mode driver is like 'OS code' for managing the GPU tasks, processes accesing the GPU, permissions, security, concurrency ...  It has full permissions like the OS.",
